


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_28b9534b:


    "——课间休息。室友们聚集在阳菜的座位旁。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_99ae95db:



    voice "2HI_0799"
    hina "「呐，关于祥子姐的巧克力啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_4adde6a6:


    "整理着收上来的文件，阳菜抬起了头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_08af79c5:



    voice "2RI_0806"
    rin "「不说我都完全忘了。阳菜你不送么」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_2ce86d7b:


    "望着窗外发呆的伦也转过头来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_ca249d6d:



    voice "2HI_0800"
    hina "「怎么办好呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_badaee68:



    voice "2FU_0656"
    fumi "「欸，你们不送么！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_b2e1f3cf:


    "文发出了惊讶的声音，看了看阳菜和伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_8c6b4849:



    voice "2HI_0801"
    hina "「义理的也好还是送一个吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_9b83325f:



    voice "2FU_0657"
    fumi "「我一开始就打算送的呢……啊咧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_8963c255:


    "对看法的差异感到困惑的文。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_c3d3c23c:



    voice "2RI_0807"
    rin "「啊不，我也知道送还是要送的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_f3aac8bf:



    voice "2HI_0802"
    hina "「总觉得一本正经的送给她太羞耻了啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_4ae2ce3d:



    voice "2FU_0658"
    fumi "「啊哈哈，那就当做是平日的感谢不就好了么」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_4fb1b11a:



    voice "2HI_0803"
    hina "「也是呢，受了她不少照顾呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_5b723fd3:



    voice "2RI_0808"
    rin "「啊，那个巧克力可以联名赠送么？“101室全体赠送”这样的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_1e9b7153:



    voice "2HI_0804"
    hina "「有礼签纸的那种」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a512d60f:



    voice "2FU_0659"
    fumi "「那个好像有点不太一样～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_1c34b7e6:



    voice "2MI_0741"
    miyako "「那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_9802883e:


    "弱弱地举起手的圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_fbed502c:



    voice "2RI_0809"
    rin "「啊，圣夜夜也要联名么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_49610cc0:



    voice "2MI_0742"
    miyako "「联名比较好么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_400b0e4a:



    voice "2FU_0660"
    fumi "「完全不需要联名的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_04c84625:



    voice "2RI_0810"
    rin "「哦哇？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_d48421b2:


    "强势地插入话题的文。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_84209453:



    voice "2FU_0661"
    fumi "「圣夜子想以个人的名义亲手送给祥子姐对吧！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_7783ba07:



    voice "2MI_0743"
    miyako "「是、是这样的。能做出来的话……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_48a08bc5:



    voice "2FU_0662"
    fumi "「绝不能让圣夜子的本命巧克力被联名埋没！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_e318f059:


    "伦被文用手指着训斥了一顿。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_75efa419:



    voice "2RI_0811"
    rin "「……对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_adcd1d90:


    "面对低下了头的伦，圣夜子摇了摇头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_d2b193d6:



    voice "2FU_0663B"
    fumi "「特别的心意，就用特别的巧克力去传达吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_9cd1d094:


    "文紧紧地抓住了圣夜子的手，比当事人还要来劲。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_2e136f63:



    voice "2MI_0744"
    miyako "「我，我加油」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_029e0c2c:



    voice "2FU_0664"
    fumi "「对了！圣夜子，放学后要不要一起去看看装饰的材料呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_556a08c5:



    voice "2MI_0745"
    miyako "「嗯，是礼签纸？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_62f4320c:



    voice "2FU_0665"
    fumi "「……不是的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_1f735c1f:



    voice "2FU_0666"
    fumi "「比礼签纸要更绚丽多彩的闪闪发光的东西！巧克力的盒子要用漂亮的礼品纸和彩带来装饰」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_718f4981:



    voice "2MI_0746"
    miyako "「绚丽多彩、闪闪发光……看来会很有趣！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_867a00ac:


    "上钩了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_65178bc7:



    voice "2FU_0667"
    fumi "「嗯，超有趣的！特别的巧克力就是要用特别的装饰啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_09b42f4e:



    voice "2MI_0747"
    miyako "「我想试试！ ……不过我也能做得到么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_9df1fa54:



    voice "2FU_0668"
    fumi "「放行吧我会教你的！买好材料后就进行包装教学吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_48976c93:



    voice "2MI_0748"
    miyako "「从头到尾都要拜托你了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_a4ab8ece:



    voice "2FU_0669"
    fumi "「从头到尾都交给我吧♪我也很乐意的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_5bbc3b0d:


    "（尤其是关于恋爱）有些人在援助他人的时候会比自己的事情还要来劲。比如说这里就有一个。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_e15ea16b:



    voice "2MI_0749"
    miyako "「……她会开心么」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_07205637:


    "圣夜子呢喃着，把手放在胸口，想要抑制自己的激动。是混杂着期待与不安的恋爱中少女的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_952dc7ca:


    hina_rin "「嚯喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_a96a8f14:


    "似乎连伦和阳菜都情不自禁地叹了一口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_2614a4f4:


    "原来，她也会露出这样的表情呢。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_bfd22da7:


    "嚯喔。"




translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_c67c048b:


    voice "2FU_0664"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_11_a_70c95ac2:


    fumi "「对了！圣夜子，放学后要不要一起去看看装饰的材料呢？」"
